            "reviewBody": "I substituted chicken tenders in a coconut shrimp recipe, and used this dipping sauce. This is a perfect blend of only 4 ingredients with NO cooking. t doesn’t get much easier than this. Total nirvana! About 5 shakes of Tabasco gave it the perfect zing."
