              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Dawna Smith Miller"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I loved the simplicity and the bold flavor of this sauce! I used it as an impromptu dip for fish sticks and could almost taste the coconut that wasn't actually there, LOL! The sauce was super simple and the mustard balanced the marmalade very nicely. I used sriracha since the sauce, to me, goes in an Asian/Caribbean direction. I would definitely make it again!",
            "datePublished": "2019-12-16T05:26:52.963Z"
